OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a little brightness to start the
OL,7,Fevening, otherwise mainly cloudy with
OL,8,Fa few showers. Some clear spells later
OL,9,Facross Orkney. Moderate winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA rather cool and cloudy day
OL,12,Fwith further showers moving across
OL,13,Ffrom the west. Best of the sunny
OL,14,Fspells across Orkney.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and scattered showers on Sunday
OL,18,Fthen mainly dry on Monday. Showers or
OL,19,Flonger spells of rain on Tuesday.
OL,20,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
